    Themed-icon layer: the color mark's own geometry, not a redrawn substitute. A themed icon
    renders as one flat color, so the mark's stacked planes are reduced to a single evenOdd
    path — the envelope traced as one outline (no shared interior edges, which would render as
    hairline seams) with the flap punched through it, leaving the open interior as negative
    space. Scaled to sit inside the 72dp themed safe zone.
-->
